<body>
<div class="card">

<div class="meta">
  <div class="badge">JL-058 · ¥19.9</div>
  <h1>JL-058 VC蜜汁酱</h1>
  <div class="sub">韩式炸鸡酱 · 摆摊 ✅ 炸鸡店 ✅ 家庭 ✅</div>
  <div class="tags">
    <span>低门槛</span>
    <span>高复购</span>
    <span>伴手</span>
    <span>适合搭配炸鸡</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="level-banner">
  <span class="level-item high">推荐 ★★★★★</span>
  <span class="level-item med">新手可做</span>
  <span class="level-item med">回本快</span>
  <span class="level-item med">利润稳</span>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">发现这款产品</div>
  <div class="story">
    厦门有个台湾阿嬷开的炸鸡摊，她的招牌酱叫「VC蜜汁酱」——名字很特别。我问她为什么叫VC，她说因为酱里放了柠檬汁和橙汁，富含维生素C，而且味道酸甜开胃。我尝了一口，那种清新的果酸和蜂蜜的甜完美融合，和炸鸡搭在一起一点都不腻。<br><br>
    阿嬷说这个酱是她女儿发明的——女儿是营养师，觉得传统炸鸡酱太重口，想做一款清爽的果味酱。用鲜榨橙汁和柠檬汁代替白醋，用蜂蜜代替部分糖，加入一点点姜汁提味，调出来就是那种「吃炸鸡的健康感」。<br><br>
    <em>VC蜜汁酱最大的卖点是「清爽不腻」——很多女生不敢吃炸鸡是怕腻，但配上这个果味蜜汁酱，炸鸡的酥脆和酱的酸甜在嘴里形成对比，越吃越想吃。阿嬷的摊位因为这个酱，女性顾客比例比其他摊高了两倍。一份VC蜜汁炸鸡不仅好吃，端出去颜色也好看——金黄的炸鸡裹着微黄透亮的酱汁，上面还能看到细碎的橙皮屑。</em>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">项目指数</div>
  <div class="index-grid">
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">轻资产</div><div class="num">★★★★★</div><div class="desc">投入约250元</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">难度</div><div class="num">★★☆☆☆</div><div class="desc">1天学会</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">利润</div><div class="num">★★★★☆</div><div class="desc">60%毛利率</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">复购</div><div class="num">★★★★★</div><div class="desc">清爽口感回头高</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">成本利润</div>
  <div class="cost-box">
    <div class="row"><span>卖价（100g/份）</span><span class="v">10元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>成本（批量调制）</span><span class="v">约4元/份</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>单份利润</span><span class="v" style="color:#C0392B">约6元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销30份日利润</span><span class="v">180元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销50份日利润</span><span class="v">300元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销80份日利润</span><span class="v">480元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>月固定开销</span><span class="v">约300元</span></div>
    <div class="row tot"><span>设备投入</span><span class="v">约250元</span></div>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;margin-top:6px">回本周期</div>
  <div class="roi">
    <div class="roi-b c"><div>保守</div><div class="d">3天</div><div>日销30份</div></div>
    <div class="roi-b n"><div>正常</div><div class="d">2天</div><div>日销50份</div></div>
    <div class="roi-b i"><div>理想</div><div class="d">1天</div><div>日销80份</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">项目风险</div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>保存期限</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">冷藏15天，果汁易氧化</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>果汁氧化</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">橙汁接触空气会氧化变味</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>价格敏感</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">比普通甜酱成本高一点</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>淡旺季</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">夏天卖得比冬天好</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">启动清单</div>
  <div class="launch">
    <span>不锈钢锅（小号）60元</span>
    <span>密封罐（10个）40元</span>
    <span>电子秤 30元</span>
    <span>水果榨汁器 15元</span>
    <span>硅胶刮刀 15元</span>
    <span>标签贴纸 10元</span>
    <span>一次性酱料杯 0.3元/个</span>
    <span>手动打蛋器 10元</span>
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;color:#5a4f44">
    <span><strong>总投入：</strong>约250元</span>
    <span><strong>占地：</strong>1m台面</span>
    <span><strong>人员：</strong>1人</span>
    <span><strong>上手：</strong>1天</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">适合场景</div>
  <div class="scene-grid">
    <span class="scene-item">炸鸡摊</span>
    <span class="scene-item">轻食店</span>
    <span class="scene-item">家庭厨房</span>
    <span class="scene-item">外卖档口</span>
    <span class="scene-item">学校周边</span>
    <span class="scene-item">商场美食街</span>
    <span class="scene-item">儿童餐</span>
    <span class="scene-item">减脂轻食</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">搭配销售</div>
  <div class="dpair">
    <div class="dpair-item"><div class="name">VC蜜汁炸鸡</div><div class="price">15-20元/份</div></div>
    <div class="dpair-item"><div class="name">炸鸡柳</div><div class="price">10元/份</div></div>
    <div class="dpair-item"><div class="name">蔬菜沙拉</div><div class="price">8元/份</div></div>
    <div class="dpair-item"><div class="name">水果拼盘</div><div class="price">10元/份</div></div>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size:11px;color:#7a7269;margin-top:6px">女性客群最爱，搭配炸鸡和沙拉做套餐，客单价轻松25+</div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">对标项目 & 竞争优势</div>
  <div class="comp">
    <div class="comp-item"><span>超市蜜汁酱</span><span class="tag adv">鲜榨果汁</span><span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0">超市酱用香精调果味，我用真果汁</span></div>
    <div class="comp-item"><span>其他摊位甜酱</span><span class="tag adv">果酸解腻</span><span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0">别人甜酱齁甜，我有果酸解腻</span></div>
    <div class="comp-item"><span>快餐店甜酸酱</span><span class="tag adv">维C概念</span><span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0">主打维C健康概念是差异化卖点</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">销售话术</div>
  <div class="copy-box">
    「妹子，试试VC蜜汁酱？<em>用鲜榨橙汁调的，酸酸甜甜特别开胃</em>。」<br>
    「这个酱配炸鸡绝了——酥脆的外皮裹着清爽的果味蜜汁，一点都不腻。」<br>
    「你看这个颜色，新鲜橙汁调出来的，跟香精调的那种不一样。」<br>
    「VC蜜汁炸鸡套餐，鸡+酱+沙拉一共18块，女生都爱这么吃。」<br>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">避坑指南</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 橙汁必须现榨不能用浓缩汁——浓缩还原橙汁经过高温处理后风味损失严重，调出来的酱和香精味没区别。必须用新鲜橙子现榨，VC含量也高</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 柠檬汁不能放太多——柠檬酸度太高，放多了酱会变得尖酸，盖住橙汁的甜香。每100克蜂蜜配15毫升柠檬汁就够了，柠檬是提味不是主味</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 加热温度不能超过80℃——蜂蜜和果汁中的维生素在高温下会被破坏。熬酱时小火加热到微微冒泡就关火，不要煮沸，否则VC全没了</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 酱做好后要避光保存——橙汁中的维生素C见光会加速氧化降解。用棕色或不透明的瓶子装，放在冰箱冷藏最深处</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 果酱搭配炸鸡时不要把酱和炸鸡提前混合——炸鸡的热度会让果汁加速氧化，而且放久了炸鸡皮会变软。建议蘸着吃，不要拌在一起</div>
</div>

<div class="pay">
